{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34407","headline":"顷自桐江得一钓车以袭美乐烟波之思因出以爲玩俄辱三篇复抒酬荅 一 · 陆龟蒙","name":"顷自桐江得一钓车以袭美乐烟波之思因出以爲玩俄辱三篇复抒酬荅 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旋屈金钩劈翠筠，手中盘作钓鱼轮。\n忘情不效孤醒客，有意闲窥百丈鳞。\n雨似轻埃时一起，云如高盖强相亲。\n任他华毂低头笑，此地终无覆败人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}